<title>USA: Century Telephone Q1 net per share rises.</title>
<headline>Century Telephone Q1 net per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONROE, La. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.55		    $0.50</p>
<p> Net			 33,135		   29,665</p>
<p> Revs		     198,985		  175,814</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,880		   60,204</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Century Telephone Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization for Q1 1997 were $99.5 million vs $89.5 million for Q1 1996.</p>
</text>
